{"v":[[1,"O God, why hast thou cast us off for ever? why doth thine anger smoke against the sheep of thy pasture?"],[2,"Remember thy congregation, which thou hast purchased of old; the rod of thine inheritance, which thou hast redeemed; this mount Zion, wherein thou hast dwelt."],[3,"Lift up thy feet unto the perpetual desolations; even all that the enemy hath done wickedly in the sanctuary."],[4,"Thine enemies roar in the midst of thy congregations; they set up their ensigns for signs."],[5,"A man was famous according as he had lifted up axes upon the thick trees."],[6,"But now they break down the carved work thereof at once with axes and hammers."],[7,"They have cast fire into thy sanctuary, they have defiled by casting down the dwelling place of thy name to the ground."],[8,"They said in their hearts, Let us destroy them together: they have burned up all the synagogues of God in the land."],[9,"We see not our signs: there is no more any prophet: neither is there among us any that knoweth how long."],[10,"O God, how long shall the adversary reproach? shall the enemy blaspheme thy name for ever?"],[11,"Why withdrawest thou thy hand, even thy right hand? pluck it out of thy bosom."],[12,"For God is my King of old, working salvation in the midst of the earth."],[13,"Thou didst divide the sea by thy strength: thou brakest the heads of the dragons in the waters."],[14,"Thou brakest the heads of leviathan in pieces, and gavest him to be meat to the people inhabiting the wilderness."],[15,"Thou didst cleave the fountain and the flood: thou driedst up mighty rivers."],[16,"The day is thine, the night also is thine: thou hast prepared the light and the sun."],[17,"Thou hast set all the borders of the earth: thou hast made summer and winter."],[18,"Remember this, that the enemy hath reproached, O Lord, and that the foolish people have blasphemed thy name."],[19,"O deliver not the soul of thy turtledove unto the multitude of the wicked: forget not the congregation of thy poor for ever."],[20,"Have respect unto the covenant: for the dark places of the earth are full of the habitations of cruelty."],[21,"O let not the oppressed return ashamed: let the poor and needy praise thy name."],[22,"Arise, O God, plead thine own cause: remember how the foolish man reproacheth thee daily."],[23,"Forget not the voice of thine enemies: the tumult of those that rise up against thee increaseth continually."]],"w":{"1":[["la-mah","<to> why?","H4100"],["'elohim","O God","H430"],["zanachta","have you rejected [us]","H2186"],["la-netzach","to perpetuity","H5331"],["ye'shan","does it smoke?","H6225"],["'ape-kha","anger your","H639"],["be-tzon","on [the] sheep of","H6629"],["mar'ite-kha","pasture your","H4830"]],"2":[["zekhor","remember","H2142"],["'adate-kha","congregation your","H5712"],["kanita","[which] you acquired","H7069"],["kedem","antiquity","H6924"],["ga'alta","[which] you redeemed","H1350"],["shevet","[the] tribe of","H7626"],["nachalate-kha","inheritance your","H5159"],["har","[the] mountain of","H2022"],["tziyon","Zion","H6726"],["zeh","which","H2088"],["shakhanta","you have dwelt","H7931"],["b-o","on it",""]],"3":[["harima-h","lift up !","H7311"],["fe'amei-kha","footsteps your","H6471"],["le-mashu'ot","to [the] ruins of","H4876"],["netzach","perpetuity","H5331"],["kol","everything","H3605"],["hera'","he has done harm to","H7489"],["'oyev","[the] enemy","H341"],["ba-kodesh","in the sanctuary","H6944"]],"4":[["sha'agu","they roared","H7580"],["tzorerei-kha","opposers your","H6887"],["be-kerev","in [the] midst of","H7130"],["mo'ade-kha","appointed place your","H4150"],["samu","they set up","H7760"],["'otota-m","signs their","H226"],["'otot","signs","H226"]],"5":[["yivada'","it was known","H3045"],["ke-mevi'","like [one who] brings","H935"],["le-ma'ela-h","<to> upwards <towards>","H4605"],["bi-savokh","in a thicket of","H5442"],["'etz","tree[s]","H6086"],["kardumot","axes","H7134"]],"6":[["ve-'atah","and now","H6258"],["pituchei-ha","engravings its